  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sikiliza sauti yetu: Dunia inaita! Supporting youth-centred civil society and community engagement in climate action in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action contributes to strengthening the capacity, voice and civic engagement in particular of youths, with emphasis on environmental protection actions and climate policy debates on climate adaptation at national and local level. It specifically supports the targeted CSO/CBOs to directly engage in community, county or national dialogues and plans (Output 2) through relevant capacity building (Output 1) and multi-stakeholder dialogues (e.g: Green Think Tanks) (Output 3).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
